== width 80 ==
● <note>! Note</>
    A note with <c>code</> and <b>bold</>, long enough to wrap at a narrow width.

  <tip>! Tip</>
    Lower case works too.

  <important>! Important</>
    First paragraph.

    <d>•</> a list in an alert

  <warning>! Warning</>
    <c>-count 20</> takes 38 s under <c>-race</>.

  <caution>! Caution</>

  <d>“ </><d><i>[!UNKNOWN]</></>
    <d><i>Not an alert: the marker stays.</></><d> ”</>

  <d>“ </><d><i>A plain quote.</></><d> ”</>
