== width 20 ==
● <note>! Note</>
    A note with <c>code</>
    and <b>bold</>, long
    enough to wrap
    at a narrow
    width.

  <tip>! Tip</>
    Lower case works
    too.

  <important>! Important</>
    First paragraph.

    <d>•</> a list in an
      alert

